  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l002": "Printed кең болдум retained as grew broad; cotton sash is dress imagery, confirmed by1465:21 кең өтүк broad boots. No missing boots silently supplied here. Exact force of broad remains uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l007": "Cliff without a ledge and nestless solitude1461:9 retained literally as despair images; no topographic correction.",
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l011": "сурак rule/government, https://el-sozduk.kg/сурак/; Kongurbay laments lost sovereignty, mosque imposed within Beijing and bronze idol taken as spoils1461:13–15.",
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l017": "Printed Шуйку shortened Shuykuchu preserved as Shuyku.",
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l022": "Printed slaughtering Chinese retained beside forty-day manufacture of the axe; exact relation of killings to manufacture is unclear.1461:24 tip without joining provisionally describes single-piece forging.",
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l032": "Калча Kongurbay’s grim-faced epithet: Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/калча/ I1–2, repeated throughout. күлүстөн=гүлүстөн affectionate dear one, often in laments: https://el-sozduk.kg/күлү/ and https://el-sozduk.kg/гүлүстөн/. Qualified affectionate narrator epithet; not an invented rank.",
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l036": "Абайы precious cloth, Yudakhin/1969 https://el-sozduk.kg/абайы/; horse richly adorned here.",
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l037": "теңиз sea metaphor retained here and1461:39 sea-like life; possible association with boundless/generous qualities, not an actual sea or new personal name.",
    "manas-2010:p1461:b001:l040": "карапчы armored sleeves/arm armor, exact source glossary1838:b001:l042. Entire clothing term translated into English, raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p1462:b001:l019": "Early thinking/late outcome retained provisionally; syntax compressed.1462:21 two eyes becoming four preserves numerical idiom of anxious watching.",
    "manas-2010:p1462:b001:l029": "очогор matchlock, wick-fired gun per2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/очогор/, not flintlock.",
    "manas-2010:p1462:b001:l038": "арбак ancestral/spiritual might provoking terror; no genealogical or supernatural mechanism invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1463:b001:l017": "сан epic multitude unit rendered vast host, no fixed census. Same unit at1474:40.",
    "manas-2010:p1463:b001:l025": "керимсел hot dry wind, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/кери/; simile retained provisionally, not silently changed to mirage.",
    "manas-2010:p1463:b001:l037": "Printed Агаяр preserved as Agayar, not harmonized to Ayar.",
    "manas-2010:p1464:b001:l003": "Verse wraps into1464:4 мыктуу кул in rendering; both provisional source display rows retained separately, not a heading or a lost verse.",
    "manas-2010:p1464:b001:l010": "Printed колго retained as hand in fire-spitting image; possible army sense of кол remains ambiguous, no raw emendation.",
    "manas-2010:p1464:b001:l019": "Зың-зың onomatopoeia rendered humming provisionally; whether voice or gear noise is not specified.",
    "manas-2010:p1464:b001:l028": "таш өбөк exact rider posture: bending over front saddle bow, arms folded over abdomen, Yudakhin/1969 https://el-sozduk.kg/өбө/. Following spear-leaning line retained too; not stone-like sleep.",
    "manas-2010:p1465:b001:l002": "Two sunna/customary and two obligatory prayer cycles, total four in next line. Printed ирекет/амаз variants interpreted in dawn-prayer context; no opaque unit retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1465:b001:l020": "кутпа sermon retained literally despite dawn-prayer context; no silent correction to qibla. Earlier1465:17 кыбыла rendered direction of Mecca.",
    "manas-2010:p1465:b001:l024": "алтын белбоо construed as golden band on axe, not a second person wearing a belt.",
    "manas-2010:p1465:b001:l034": "умачтай көзү ачыл exact idiom fully awake/clear-eyed, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/умач/. Also1467:28 and1473:36; no literal flour applied to eyes.",
    "manas-2010:p1466:b001:l010": "Printed эл people retained despite unusual wounded-rider context; no silent change to ал condition/state. Following unconsciousness translated separately.",
    "manas-2010:p1466:b001:l027": "Horse explicitly has wings on its flanks; literal epic attribute retained, not recast as merely swift movement.",
    "manas-2010:p1466:b001:l036": "Канча боор not verified as a harness term. боор dictionary gives liver/belly/slope but not initial draft straps. чап олоң belly-girth clear. Whole line withheld pending lexical/source reconciliation. Completion-first first pass: Low-confidence approximate rendering for “Канча боор, чап олоң”; nearest corpus parallel was “Канча болсо сан колду”.",
    "manas-2010:p1467:b001:l003": "Explicit survival retained alongside metaphorical dead soul revived1467:26; forty days and three meals a day retained without chronology repair.",
    "manas-2010:p1467:b001:l031": "календер mendicant religious wanderer, functional English guise; no invented affiliation.1467:36 girth-like twisted black hair describes lords’ hairstyle.",
    "manas-2010:p1468:b001:l032": "чыңыроо signaling wind instrument, Yudakhin/2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/чыңыроо/. Qualified sounded horns reading of чыккан; not generic cries or silently invented bird species.",
    "manas-2010:p1468:b001:l042": "Ысылам battle cry rendered Islam; elsewhere Muslim people follows explicit collective context.",
    "manas-2010:p1469:b001:l005": "Кан Балтай and Акбалтай1469:30 source patronymic variants retained as Khan Baltay and Akbaltay.",
    "manas-2010:p1469:b001:l016": "күн weather sense4 Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/күн/ supports storm context with күркүрө thunder; not noiseless sun.",
    "manas-2010:p1469:b001:l028": "Twenty, ten and eleven groups preserved: forty lords plus Kongurbay. No counts normalized or repetitions removed.",
    "manas-2010:p1470:b001:l009": "Алакелеп provisionally calling Alake, affectionate Almambet form; supported by adjoining plea to stop Kongurbay and explicit Almambet cry1470:13. No independent exact compound entry located.",
    "manas-2010:p1470:b001:l023": "амыз=намыс honor, exact Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/амыз/. Not left transliterated.",
    "manas-2010:p1470:b001:l035": "Printed ninety Beijings retained as epic multiplicity; not silently ninety gates.",
    "manas-2010:p1471:b001:l002": "Lake and mountain-shattering flood driving forward1471:2–3 retained as army images.",
    "manas-2010:p1471:b001:l005": "Жалгыз көз One-Eye named people; translated name retained without identifying with a historical ethnicity.",
    "manas-2010:p1471:b001:l030": "Command ranks fifty, ten, thousand and hundred translated in printed order, all numerical distinctions retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1472:b001:l010": "кабылдап wound worsening/festering from immediate grave-illness context; blue steel rust1472:12 is injured warrior metaphor, not literal rust treatment.",
    "manas-2010:p1472:b001:l019": "Causative reproach addresses Ajybay’s failure to guard Manas; no claim he deliberately commissioned Kongurbay’s attack.",
    "manas-2010:p1472:b001:l024": "Printed жактан side in a formula resembling кыймалуу жагдан ornamented iron-covered chest1255:33/1303:26. Causative чалдырган and whole phrase unresolved. Cannot silently change source or invent coffin for living wounded Manas. Completion-first first pass: Best-effort rendering from a close formulaic parallel; retain for specialist review because the source was previously unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p1472:b001:l033": "Medicine name Медет Aid, and1473:30 Себеп Remedy, translated names in this epic treatment narrative; no identification with a modern drug.",
    "manas-2010:p1473:b001:l015": "кымбат literally dear/costly; hard-won rocky passage is a qualified contextual rendering with ensuing flood/army obstacles, not a verified whole-phrase dictionary equivalence.",
    "manas-2010:p1473:b001:l026": "Printed чок rendered embers, Yudakhin чокII burning coals https://el-sozduk.kg/чок/; abrupt metaphor for faithless world retained. No silent чок→жок correction or unsupported dismissal interjection.",
    "manas-2010:p1473:b001:l038": "саруулап provisionally pale/yellowing from explicit diminished blood; raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p1473:b001:l041": "күлазык durable journey provisions mixed for drinking; no invented ingredient list.",
    "manas-2010:p1474:b001:l008": "жалгызың only child from familial homecoming context; no child’s personal name supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1474:b001:l030": "Mecca and wholesale slaughter belong to Manas’s hypothetical consequences of abandoning the army, not a claim that the slaughter already occurred. Same warning1478:7.",
    "manas-2010:p1475:b001:l004": "өзүм жалгыз I am alone retained; no unsupported restriction to only son.",
    "manas-2010:p1475:b001:l022": "Шабыят printed variant of шабиет, circle game with kicking defenders, Yudakhin/1969/2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/шабиет/. Functional English game description; not shuttlecocks.1475:23 оромпой one-legged team game, https://el-sozduk.kg/оромпой/.",
    "manas-2010:p1475:b001:l025": "ордо knucklebone game; forty young mares per stake retained next two lines, no prize reduction.",
    "manas-2010:p1476:b001:l004": "буурсун wooden plow, exact glossary1836:20–21; no deep modern mechanized furrow implied.",
    "manas-2010:p1476:b001:l013": "Narrator returns to Beijing where Manas lay while previous passage has him halt on return journey; source location/chronology discrepancy preserved, no merged camps invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1476:b001:l025": "Almambet’s lack of preparation contrasts earlier army preparations; source distinction retained. Chubak already khan1476:20 anticipates proposal1478:33; no chronology repair.",
    "manas-2010:p1476:b001:l041": "Chinese girls’ reported rumor that Manas fled to Talas preserved in speech, not harmonized with narrator’s halt.",
    "manas-2010:p1477:b001:l026": "Азирет Аалы venerable Ali, religious historical name; no claim Beijing episode is verified history.",
    "manas-2010:p1477:b001:l029": "бейжай provisionally fierce/ferocious, supported by1969/2015 ажаан and тажаал synonym entries https://el-sozduk.kg/azhaan-2/ and https://el-sozduk.kg/tazhaal-4/. Speaker’s characterization retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1479:b001:l007": "садагага как wave as ritual offering/averting harm; gruesome proposed use of Kongurbay’s lungs retained, not sanitized or converted to an enacted event.",
    "manas-2010:p1479:b001:l014": "бели бош weak resolve literal accusation after champion falls to a bullet; harsh martial fatalism retained, no negation invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1479:b001:l037": "Actual printed holy Quran oath accompanies white wheat flour chewing1479:36; holy scripture not confused with metallic braid collar.",
    "manas-2010:p1480:b001:l001": "Broad-dug pit arriving retained as compressed threatening army image; no silent ор→кол army emendation. Exact metaphor remains qualified.",
    "manas-2010:p1480:b001:l031": "Seven champions explicitly counted, matches seven preceding names; no dropped leader.",
    "manas-2010:p1480:b001:l039": "көйкашка outstanding person/champion, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/koy-12/, not untranslated epithet."
